{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1343,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eef649aa7dbb03881b0090f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我可能……无法\r\n表现得像「罗布・罗伊」那样，\r\n但我还是会尽全力奔跑……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ffff3c9ec5441ee0d0b9d005d4d368de191604ef69dfe4eb40e5869546bf2ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc9befee8e047c3e7b8bef77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我已经在脑中描绘出了\r\n赢得胜利的故事。\r\n接下来只要照着做就行了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb094723b7f73a9c2d10d211d5aa12b1474822eed19be3ba4f4f299f0907705b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ca9dbc7728c4e050399ae00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "受你照顾了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dffcc8803cca7136463544b925efdce16304e6d41ffa49eced5f5990f5a038a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdceed2954d0ca8bc69e36e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張りますっ…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b221342edaca7247b3ba07be6ebf5f865c321904900af68b645efb5b1becfff3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:476021fd29b72766c74a2c19",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "离顶点、只差一步……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "74518ff2b85a1d447eb42850e2c7f4be6997e0465e5b470b2479510a887ea75d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00a180d055690580fb31ad74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次、我一定会克服高墙……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "734ff8ead3528dd57a5d3c76da442a792b2c6de7fb5134289aec5267c3ddff34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:69595733921e7953c5e12c8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下次我会更加领先……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "464f23f0340f9820e97a4062cb053fa4b1ca078f92bcadbc4303dbcc724b5a90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f29f045128bf76fc5ebbd4ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不想止步于扮演配角……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08b2f918edba5468709473657e2559e707fef1d410373047a91d17e9146b49cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09a153c8831bb68d5e143daa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "此、此时此地……\r\n我成功缔造了传说……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d04cf2e3bec1d6da087b5aed47d3ee7a403873b22b29546291090a8f53a3d64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52021c5b64adaf8a21c33fb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可喜可贺，可喜可贺。\r\n……耶嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "135b96484539c9bc1534c1029ba4dfe606490123b47f9cffbe0fd9a3e470774b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2951743ee25254210e4dc87e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "星の海を渡るような、大冒険でした…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "29c646d21e3210dba6acf69b143b402558e2592606a58bcea90b09213de8eec0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "30006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8af5e7d5ef3908f75ae73e63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "めでたしめでたしです。\r\n…えへっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfbe6f8b998bcb242fe64aba76311722faaccd3c622d46fc17dbabcba3469ed0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "30007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc9fe8e872dc585e7648a722",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "36a5a0b930532ac9bb5ebd4e9db8bdc4552e8e44f82b5e46f8598e4724a5bb70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cfa6601ac04744ce71738d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "道路啊，为我敞开吧……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "965521db2bcedb75f66851d96c9f409a16c723473f162e801a86288c3eb7f32a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d66db7a61fa54c32df9c177",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『勝ち切れない』『目立たない』\r\n『善戦』…不甲斐ないこれまでを\r\n払拭します。この秋に、必ず…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cbb3b5f2502f0e527c28f6b2fa0b800374f95051c4463343d17032ecbf01f7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "400000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85fbb8ef120d07d4e2287a15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "全体学生参加的派对……\r\n大家变装后齐聚一堂，\r\n想必会非常华丽呢……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b85691695e4630cd86ca8cf42724cf2af9d4fb05fecc3482a5770ddfc4869db8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:151117a82bdb9ac68411c73a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看……看好了！\r\n现在我要施展最顶级的魔法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c27c7ddece48eeed32bc90200a852ba54e0363b9f7d74ceb1d8778bd45032d03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5938e16000c8608ce9432c5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要深信……自己也能成为英雄，\r\n并持续前进……总有一天一定……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "182530fdb14e1be77764833506a11dc6b6d9d938065b315f57b00c3164352150",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:027369517e9d39975a49ae78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "みなさんとても優しくて…私を、\r\n想ってくださる。その想いを糧に…\r\n必ず獲ります、秋シニア三冠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "20f88e7e13e6733180feee070409c955ef7093294fdc4730d872f28902301d80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "400010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e8b939d57e2a1a1362478c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向「梦之石」许愿……\r\n对了！……希望之后的村民们，\r\n也能有一趟美好的旅程……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc87fc2ce07ebb9d70f953ea6573979b2f6815e70741a9afc1f308d0461337c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b4ff57685dc05b981cebde8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动任务是在这里确认！\r\n攻、攻略本吗……？\r\n不晓得图书馆有没有……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5015668e7e2baedbb7d295b02d5c026608abe31e48ecec75893c062292aaaefe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0758f084feb4a972933f05b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有忘记领取的东西吗？\r\n就算是不起眼的东西，\r\n也请别忘记……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "860d5715be9660e4159c9a3e5a48cd603e6daae09a7821444234b7a80a810e92",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:081f47c82aa0f05e14c09bba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这一定是给读者的\r\n隐藏挑战书……\r\n如果只有我发现怎么办……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c0ccf2374cce99934c878f25e03c83350031987d4a9873b15a4fadc550c514e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "400028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d52fb874474b853841cb76a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "壮大な物語の始まりです！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8251272000d2211752c4cdf2d0fa997109456cbebe6d8dbec38efe38928c066e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "40003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49188719a2fbf1fe7b5da65e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふふ…まだ見ぬ世界への大冒険！\r\nたくさんのきらめき！なんて素敵な物語…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1162d80775f6e162ff0f00169a3488c062fdb21400ef98b6a24150d338c0711d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "40004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:235fa704721e4d9410698eb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请听听……由我谱写的故事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63fa3b7c4de7d3ced8e6268d1c554a03f1d9e73c411b7c3e7c9862f914e55080",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42657c82345071353762db69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇啊啊……！\r\n我是英雄，我是英雄……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1fc0bcd74178a92fa311d83b26eb485342a098d53c1a946ed76ac732fd5de69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:faee5732a2ea418384f4de92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也有机会成为故事的主角吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b21908646dc16abd6e5796b85f16dc923635bbf803c7e339cf20298eb5bea70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a49baaff6dc882e9687cde2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请你守候，你发掘到的英雄……\r\n荒漠英雄的英雄传说。",
      "source_fingerprint": "50cc14b12fc02d1b942a4c989461350d445338b9fe5fb946ee4b80f452a5cf7a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67513c79376079f87a8cb9dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学园曾培育出许多英雄，\r\n而我也是这里的学生呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "50c64334b9bebba7b16726644a82d68c78e2570b57e5d88a56af65dff01c2a45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f65a0eff2d37db1c728dad0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不习惯穿这么漂亮的衣服……\r\n适合我吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c9d55f5e3e18256dd512bad0ba567831d370a829037758ccd7242578598a038",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44fd0501f14b1ca9be6e54bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然能够穿上如书中插图一般的\r\n决胜服……我到现在还难以置信。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0f74b9195aa377880909b4105e5882ffbcf2abb569a48de2efd8574364b3523",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9446627e6a1967f9824e3b83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了不让别人说我配不上这件衣服，\r\n我必须要努力才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1e917059f771f797038ee1435bcf4553b9239b60f288a56b5d421641f1b0560",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56029d786cf8487303d1782a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还满喜欢唱歌的……因为能够……\r\n用音乐传达包含在歌词里的故事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c20ca8226fe336e1252b300e66a389651feafe6a3e009e102725e63e797ea72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e96f20b39669dedfcb383cda",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是英雄──荒漠英雄的姿态！\r\n我得成长得能抬头挺胸说出这句话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8dc63e07a5886a741a48a88ab4210fdeaece3648bd07af99f2ed88b2b494c4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:311f3688870e362458db4504",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ずっと大切にします。\r\nユニさんが選んでくれた服ですから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cadbb61b1e93556ba093cd4390d1d81fffdc3f7b429b20a590690cee69d3014",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3038792bb60b335f8463aea5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "眼鏡もいつもと少し違っていて――\r\nって、あまり近くで見られると…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c356f8155cc7fcf9c310c7bded54801ce20a65210b500a27a54c0d01577e2ba5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0befddf630c357c0fc4ff4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎、怎么样？\r\n看起来不会很奇怪吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b73f87759ca140f638010de4cbc0b5c9e991bc7055688dba589155ee96f935b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51039eb23025137eb69e2b63",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服……\r\n想必也有着很棒的故事吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5311230a43589666f5222b35c0e6921202266c2ec7f33929f3e9c7160b7a892",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97f996b7b17044ca1a4cfea3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この服は、店員さんにおすすめされたんです。\r\n…はい。勢いにおされて、そのままレジに…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b656cac733173a7f798caa618f33031436f239b54550daf751b186d1d6efc387",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17b79c551e7bf81758a720e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お出かけですか？読みかけの本を\r\n持ってくるので、少しだけ待ってください。",
      "source_fingerprint": "784d526ae175620891e5a96b8df0aef26c8bb5483a25490e3861383f3e8a1896",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afd63ae65f75ee20a253f404",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学园曾培育出许多英雄，\r\n而我也是这里的学生呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "50c64334b9bebba7b16726644a82d68c78e2570b57e5d88a56af65dff01c2a45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4923075c71ed666e3fdf499",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不习惯穿这么漂亮的衣服……\r\n适合我吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c9d55f5e3e18256dd512bad0ba567831d370a829037758ccd7242578598a038",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71e29dcb641ce81a0ab1ec6f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然能够穿上如书中插图一般的\r\n决胜服……我到现在还难以置信。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0f74b9195aa377880909b4105e5882ffbcf2abb569a48de2efd8574364b3523",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:221659f8280935b3e54a9662",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了不让别人说我配不上这件衣服，\r\n我也得努力才行……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c139f8d24a6982147b8889af75a55a7faeef442da297864aac4cf7fb508453c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:600bdfac7f9308070b49ee0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我还满喜欢唱歌的……因为能够……\r\n用音乐传达包含在歌词里的故事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c20ca8226fe336e1252b300e66a389651feafe6a3e009e102725e63e797ea72",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f14a20bd0c12e651c318cd97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是英雄──荒漠英雄的姿态！\r\n我得成长得能抬头挺胸说出这句话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8dc63e07a5886a741a48a88ab4210fdeaece3648bd07af99f2ed88b2b494c4b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c546ca5542793c57bae1c31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ずっと大切にします。\r\nユニさんが選んでくれた服ですから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cadbb61b1e93556ba093cd4390d1d81fffdc3f7b429b20a590690cee69d3014",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ae84a09460e5d3fe4e07a8f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "眼鏡もいつもと少し違っていて――\r\nって、あまり近くで見られると…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c356f8155cc7fcf9c310c7bded54801ce20a65210b500a27a54c0d01577e2ba5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f986ce320bd870e96dbe1285",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎、怎么样？\r\n看起来不会很奇怪吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "b73f87759ca140f638010de4cbc0b5c9e991bc7055688dba589155ee96f935b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e493ee16f8e2176c10bff427",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服……\r\n想必也有着很棒的故事吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5311230a43589666f5222b35c0e6921202266c2ec7f33929f3e9c7160b7a892",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:898069331cc2be73aa483830",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f747fdfd41fdd19d5e6205e2563472ecb3e45190ea9201c283e895272ee13e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:482e8056e5f1e8b7d163a173",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "その…語り継がれる名勝負を\r\n演じましょう…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b333ac352ab9720bace3f3b7b59ae8caa59438b3ddaf9ec657236ce1e565bcb3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:255dd8103bde5d2dd89b1953",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まだ、お見せしていない\r\nエピソードがあるんです…！\r\n次はきっと…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c148b02bd21820d6fc158e63481c44206b1cbb138d1aa26f2de8d3783444179",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:060e781b04f4dfaa8326cb7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想在早上读书的话我推荐短篇集！\r\n可以依照当天心情，\r\n无负担地享受故事中的世界。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e7b3ec8ae495b8322b70b314bbb05d4744c72cdb7565d504054e22bb0b0ffbb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f6dda64931a43b3115fecae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我听过一个传说，\r\n据说瞌睡虫是由妖精带来的喔。\r\n说不定现在正在训练员肩膀上呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "be62620bb6a96f60e4f29d2e05923a485082a2760b9b93d2a71902c4883ea2a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd9984148635db693a308968",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽说打造强健的体格是成为英雄的\r\n必要条件……但大家吃的午餐份量\r\n对我来说好像有点太多了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e64c1e71cb75cd2883f7e1a5ddcdd3b2b48587513afb727733ba394e41feb720",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b143f0308700b71fbf46affb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "故事读到最高潮时午休时间刚好\r\n结束，让我好在意后续的发展……\r\n连下午的课都彷佛在考验我……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1218a13bb270535d1863092279ac55654acec4c426982907a8092b794720ae36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d624d58ddb7087e00f7eed4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜晚时光读点好故事如何？\r\n我想推荐一本书，结局很圆满，\r\n看完能够神清气爽地入睡……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e007325e11d72edca92d4a70d0cc43ad086c439c3b513393e9ae7003868f10ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9acda4b1a4c678189325e279",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢妖精跟精灵，但妖怪嘛……\r\n我就有点……\r\n不，是非常地……想敬而远之……",
      "source_fingerprint": "27f6340292824c37ca30e6d9b23a6baed33ee3f35101b673d98146eb2b15befb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfe39b68cebe3a563c04bc25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员有没有花粉症的困扰？\r\n我随时都可以为你介绍\r\n能防止花粉的眼镜喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5351cf2cb07b5b22288d291a54f956e8382f4b4cc4c30d4c32b25485bb186e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7651cac15d6acbc824a9b5e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "暑假想去哪里……？我想去英国。\r\n英国这块土地上诞生过无数\r\n传承至今的故事，我想去亲眼看看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a7b9b7aa9bd942a646583acad17118e0ff6e1684ae55b10a38c543c3eecd1a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:343b81451e80f95fc1032c50",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "读书之秋来临了呢！\r\n我有很多想推荐的书单，\r\n想读书随时都可以来问我喔……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d453a3a5ab29468c183894ca365f117de7614bb62b7454ecd526be15f8cac26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf3f84d620e6c0b54075e584",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万籁俱寂的下雪天，坐在暖炉旁\r\n边听着木材燃烧的声音边读书……\r\n令我好向往呀……♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "84a56ec649ad5b5081c45f41b5fb2418c27dd3e880f0fa2af0c63e491cd00a0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3995b5796ed8ed124d0b73c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おはようございます。朝日が\r\n燦燦と輝いていると、頑張らないと\r\nって気が引き締まりますね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddc05ff5f4381d91b074d63ee35064a3dc75ac7960944eb70ec162a5edbe7bc8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:397ba7efa784507933087886",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うぅん…おもしろい夢を見た気が\r\nするんですが、思い出せなくて。\r\n夢日記、つけてみようかな？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e96722c0777f9d39d989206d9d766486b83366263903590e52fac626f0feae16",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef78138905283467581dc064",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ユニさんと一緒にお昼ご飯を\r\n食べてきたんですが、とっても――\r\n『スフィーラ』な時間でした♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c6d2d3b2453383801b2197f3d77c5c9777c6bdd9f69f5cd0bee2569fbf5b717",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:892b4c9ea69dbc1760cf9fa2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "水の違いがわかるってカッコいい\r\nですよね…！私もいつか、\r\nクリスエスさんみたいに…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d4fbd95493e6df39c8beb7b3373e3397fedd991c8c29fee9ea86e6ce7c9e5c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64f7648ec57f12a89af210fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今夜のお供はミステリー…？\r\n青春もの…？ううん、やっぱり\r\nファンタジーにしちゃおうかな…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbd03eb77615ee7ac93f4ba65a7da463f341f0d6361d55c5313d85b4f64a64c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6f3194fcae1834b88365103",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "眠る前のあの一瞬…夢と現実の\r\n狭間にいる時が、1日の中で最も\r\n素敵な時間かもしれません♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "382774a257ff0687595d4e007438b54a139ce3da5b083d2767ff2f945f9f3bb9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84b6b1c756d8737f63ab1a34",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜桜の下を歩いているだけで\r\n物語の中にいるみたいに思える…\r\nとても幻想的で、素敵ですよね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "62f67df5347090d263f211c0e6326362b0b120a6d34a5b1e8118fb43e1059ca7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef4d53293f44988f33f02a61",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏をエンジョイできる水着を選んで\r\nくださるとタイキさんが…！わ、\r\n私に着こなせるんでしょうか…！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f513cc439ba8f85b0dea825b8ff61f2b50b7bb8ceb2c5caf00395777090c775",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e87e852a6b6229ef452e4a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "またみんなでお月見したいなぁ。\r\n食べ物に飲み物、それから今度は\r\nたくさんの物語も持ち寄って。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c1a7dd3094e50af235ba1f02e0b1a3a2127a3ccfe5c3f2e290a31b178db5f93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4b8582d10a76cc0b88dd55a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この服、学園のコートと合わせると\r\n少し落ち着いた雰囲気になって…\r\nまた違った味わいになるんです♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6901a2c47b24ca9cbf7c59da302def5ecf38553a7f1b0d1b9657080d03ac8bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9c9380fc002257dff2bc748",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b864b7841af89022e20379f78c16aa3ac36fd63bcfd3cb24ab6d04b749dcdc58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d683c2fc302255a4fb11e5ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイン……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d2dee3aebc92accd3d836ee63bfb4f9dfa6a4e5b1bb5580ac2652dcc2fd570c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d0f5420e75a4010bed24c17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "咖啡好厉害喔……！\r\n只要告诉她书本内容，\r\n她就能配合故事挑出适合的咖啡！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52e77bd468b7797e944dffcb0de04bc49c1eadb31def940ff328a7bef319e335",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60fa92471b542d2db849ab40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吉兆总是以实力服人，\r\n不倚赖言语。她是我的理想……\r\n我总会忍不住看向她……",
      "source_fingerprint": "96c63d8c40e879563c2864b52c305c263272c9441f3e1893e9a478111fc34bcc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e00fd23424a68674953c392d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向织姬介绍了几本有关星星的书后，\r\n我们就变得更常聊天了。\r\n……她真的很喜欢星星呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90e7b815e3577d96141930d76b63c2fbc4967fd902c22cb4c8e2b835e5a32797",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e478dd88c88665c7e835c6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算心情沮丧，\r\n只要跟变革聊聊天就能打起精神。\r\n笑容的魔法……真的好厉害喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "284df0686879c9eb4f3abe77e0cf09d0df7edfa3375d4370ad7c01781baaed71",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1047",
        "91003"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
